		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Flame-wreathed skeleton surrounded by oily smoke.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +2 (1d4 + combust) or 1 fire bolt (near) +0 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Combust</strong>. Catch fire, 1d4 damage each round. Douse with water, stop, drop, and roll to quench.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vulnerabilities</strong>. Double damage from cold. Flask of water does 1d6 damage, 3d6 damage if holy water.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
